		["The Leech Stalkers and Cave Stalkers crawl around 46,61 in the middle of the {zone:1437}; they drop the {item:6838}."] = "Los acechadores sanguijuela y los acechadores de cuevas rondan por 46,61, en el centro de {zone:1437}; sueltan {item:6838}.",
